    <string name="setup_step1">1. Enable Bright Keyboard</string>
    <string name="setup_step2">2. Choose it as your keyboard</string>
    <string name="setup_scope">Light’s own tools — Messages, Notes, Directory — draw their keyboard themselves and keep it whatever you choose here. Bright Keyboard appears in the apps you install yourself.</string>
